        MALF: A Multi-Agent LLM Framework for Intelligent Fuzzing of Industrial Control Protocols
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ning%2C+B">Bowei Ning</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zong%2C+X">Xuejun Zong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=He%2C+K">Kan He</a>
      
